  "unresolved": [
    "Five official Japan photographs including bare rear views were visually inspected; the depicted Leica M-style version does not establish Nikon Z-specific rear/four-direction coverage. Focus/aperture rings and distance/depth-of-field scales are visible; the China Leica M-specific focus limiter is not assigned to Nikon Z.",
    "The 58 x 59 mm and approximately 228 g values are generic and Japan explicitly notes mount variation. Existing Z measurements are retained pending Z-specific confirmation and accessory measurement conditions remain unresolved.",
    "China separately lists a Light edition (camera-lens-79) and a DSLR edition (camera-lens-45); those versions are not used to replace original FF RL specifications. The original/Light Nikon Z relationship remains unresolved.",
    "The 114-degree angle orientation, coatings, aperture click behavior, electronic contacts, environmental protection and external length behavior remain unconfirmed. Japan notes no hood for DL, but explicit Nikon Z hood/accessory supply remains unresolved. No matching original-edition manual was located and global product-page access returned 403."
  ]
